---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ label: 'Private Label', href: '/private-label/' }];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Private Label Filter Supply"
  description="Private-label automotive filter supply — own-brand or neutral packaging, marking and multi-SKU runs under your brand."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:2rem;max-width:820px;">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Private Label</nav>
    <h1>Private-label filter supply</h1>

    <p class="lede" style="max-width:70ch;">
      Sell filters under your own brand. Private-label supply covers own-brand or neutral
      packaging, marking to your artwork, and multi-SKU runs across the automotive filter range.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>What private label covers</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="data">
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">Condition</th><th scope="col">Options</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>Branding</strong></td><td>Your own brand or neutral (unbranded) marking.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Packaging</strong></td><td>Plain carton, retail box, polybag or custom-printed packaging.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Labelling</strong></td><td>Barcode, part number and logo per your artwork.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Marking</strong></td><td>Multi-SKU runs supported across standard and custom sizes.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Process</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Send your brand artwork, target SKU range and quantity.</li>
        <li>Confirm packaging, labelling and marking specification.</li>
        <li>Approve a first article against the specification.</li>
        <li>Serial production with the approved sample kept as the batch reference.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>MOQ and lead time</h2>
      <p>
        Private-label runs are quoted per line. The packaging and marking requirement is part of
        the specification, so stating it up front — alongside the SKU range and quantity — is what
        converts an inquiry into an accurate quote. Custom-printed packaging and marking add lead
        time versus plain-carton supply.
      </p>
      <p class="notice" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        Scope boundary: private-label supply is offered for automotive filters, the manufacturing
        range of Qinghe Huiying. Industrial, HVAC, HEPA/ULPA and liquid products on this platform
        are not Huiying-manufactured.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Start a private-label inquiry</h2>
      <p>
        State the target SKU range, quantity, and the branding and packaging requirement. We
        respond with an MOQ, lead-time and price indication per line.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/rfq/">Submit an RFQ →</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/oem/" style="margin-left:0.5rem;">OEM / ODM</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact/" style="margin-left:0.5rem;">Contact</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
